  Key Improvements

  1. OS variant fix - Now correctly uses freebsd15.0 to match the image
  2. Tags - Can now run selective parts of playbooks with --tags
  3. Restart operation - New -e operation=restart
  4. Status table - Matches bash script's nice table format
